Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep runnin' along.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch as we pass by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As we raise our flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Up high in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, here we go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sailing through the endless ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Facing all that comes by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for our treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody has ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to witness with their own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is keep\Nbelieving in our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And let our heart lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then once we got all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All there's left is to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When we face the dark and stormy weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll link our hearts together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure we'll make it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.14,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Still raising our flag as we journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Though our chances are close to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't back down from anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase.\NLet's start up the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Toward our own dreams\Nwhile keeping the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With a compass pointing to our goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't stop till we've\Ngone around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Start me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.60,0:01:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll never stop,\Ntill we're at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that we'll ever quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep heading for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase.\NLet's start up the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I see through your eyes,\Nwhat we'll have to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All the memories will stay in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Brand new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we pulled the lever!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.04,0:02:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring down the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Mozu took care\Nof things on her side, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Swahad!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the drop ridge is lowering!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.12,0:02:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our reinforcements pulled\Nit together, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:02:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And just in time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dribbling with excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking scary there, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.84,0:03:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll save you, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in high spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They sure got Gotspartan down our flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.66,0:03:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They dug their graves the\Nsecond they set foot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stay over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That garden stole Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.60,0:03:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you pirate scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.80,0:03:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let you through!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare the mortar cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him cross the bridge\Neven if you have to destroy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.78,0:03:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No way I'm gonna let you do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Five heads! Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:03:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got three heads too many!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dismantle our shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Justice Baskerville, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sike!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Jokes on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're actually the Chief Justice Trio!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Known as the left Baskerville,\Nmy true name is Bass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Known as the right Baskerville,\Nmy name is Brook. And as for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The center Baskerville. Call me\NVincent. What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.90,0:04:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean all this time it was\Nthree dudes stuck together?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.88,0:04:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we're the best of friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:04:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fire the trench mortar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.92,0:05:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd it stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn those marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.02,0:05:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They really pissed me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop getting in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We got it, Chief Spandam!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate the Tower of Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.40,0:05:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And also, good advice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This should buy me enough time\Nto get to the Gates of Justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone grab Cutty Flamm\Nand bring him too! Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They're nobodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bunch of scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I've got CP9 here,\NI'm practically invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.32,0:06:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Better yet, I've got the only person who\Ncan revive the ancient weapons, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the man who inherited\None of their blueprints, Cutty Flamm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.98,0:06:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting this\Nslip through my fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush as many pirates as it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.31,0:06:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.16,0:06:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Those aren't the real\Nblueprints for Pluton.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're real!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.78,0:06:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Luchi, Kaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys can tell, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:07:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Suppose we should have seen this coming
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.74,0:07:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can hide soda and\Nweapons in your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you can hide blueprints just as easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So, they are real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.28,0:07:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They're really real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then hand them over!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Saves me the trouble\Nof searching for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit, the rumors I heard about\Nyou were about as wrong as they could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,While the government was\Ndragging us to this crap hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I realize that you\Naren't the monster that's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.58,0:07:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,going to use the ancient\Ntechnology for evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the shipwrights from\NWater 7 have been passing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,down these blueprints from\Ngeneration to generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're not doing it to revive a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.72,0:07:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom had achieved so many wonderful things,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but he gave up everything to keep\Nthese blueprints hidden from the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.76,0:07:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as the risk\Nremains that a woman named
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin can figure out\Nhow to restore the weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:08:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,then the world needs these\Nblueprints to be able to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.56,0:08:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Spanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason why Tom and Iceberg risked\Ntheir lives to protect this is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me the blueprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If an ancient weapon fell into the hands\Nof some power-hungry dumbass like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.22,0:08:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,who knows what might happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the shipwrights passed this\Nblueprint down to create
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.14,0:08:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,a possible countermeasure\Nagainst another weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I agree that Robin's\Na dangerous woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.10,0:08:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as people like you were\Naround, even if she has the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,best intentions her knowledge\Ncould still be used to wreak
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.44,0:08:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,havoc on the whole world but\Nnow she's got friends who are
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,willing to risk their lives to\Nmake sure that never happens and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're up to the job\Nso I'm making a bet now that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,everything's gone to hell I\Nhave to get a little creative if
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna uphold the wishes of\Nthe original architects just
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.42,0:08:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,shut up and hand them over\Nalready those blueprints are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom if you were here I'm\Nsure you'd do the same thing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.94,0:09:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.14,0:09:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream, it's been burned to a crisp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.68,0:09:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We spent five years on\Nour mission for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.78,0:09:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The only reason we were keeping those\Nblueprints was to create a countermeasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you took them away,\Nthat would defeat the purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that it's come to this,\Ndestroying them is all I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd rather sacrifice my own\Nplan than help you with yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you end up making a weapon after all,\Nwe won't be able to fight back anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:10:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's possible if you're able to take\NNico Robin through the Gates of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.30,0:10:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's resting on the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.18,0:10:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And if they're able to get her out of here,\Nthen you'll be left with nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've placed my bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.84,0:10:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made a mockery\Nof me for the last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.20,0:10:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh it up while you can, because\Nyou're not leaving this island alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.92,0:10:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all down here, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, big bro's right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we're not too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, I can see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll save\Nyou no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We came with the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sodom and Gomorrah fought hard too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.32,0:10:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all going home together, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.64,0:10:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't hurt you, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.28,0:10:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.19,0:10:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you to save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.82,0:10:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.46,0:11:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But you still came!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.12,0:11:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not crying, you hear me,\Nyou bastards, I'm not crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.50,0:11:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Luffy, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin's waiting. Hurry up\Nand bring down the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, right, what the\Nhell are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.46,0:11:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Get moving already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.22,0:11:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me come down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.78,0:11:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Nami, you're sexy\Nwhen you boss people around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping out\Nmy men while I was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that the gang's all here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the one and only Franky will show\Nyou how super his gratitude can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.58,0:11:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.26,0:11:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still mad about what you did to\NUsopp, so don't think we're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.68,0:12:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's, uh, right next to you, ain't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you burn my blueprints?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.26,0:12:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bros falling down the waterfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Granny Kokoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you all just standing around?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not standing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The bridge broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's halfway down, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.40,0:12:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.55,0:12:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there in about four seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump into the waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it all you've got. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.10,0:12:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.12,0:12:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:12:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.78,0:12:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, she said, jump into the waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap! Is that a train?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it doing inside the courthouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.72,0:13:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Chimney, sound that whistle\Nas loud as you can! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.48,0:13:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya-ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's the Sea Train!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.06,0:13:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up with that devious chuckle?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.56,0:13:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.18,0:14:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocket Man's as fast\Nas the day it was made.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.38,0:14:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show you\Nwhy Tom's Workers is the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.58,0:14:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,most legendary shipbuilding\Ncompany in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.48,0:14:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Rocket Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Water Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.23,0:14:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Brings back memories, don't it, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving a hand to that Roger guy\Nis something I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:15:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's something\NI take great pride in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Loopy, and I'm going\Nto be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.64,0:15:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That boy may have a screw loose, but\Ncome to think of it, so did Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.28,0:15:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All those years ago, you helped him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Tom's workers are coming together\Nagain to help out this Straw Hat boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.20,0:15:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We sure didn't learn our lesson, did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.58,0:15:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But I got a feeling you would\Nhave done the same thing, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.80,0:15:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.90,0:16:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.44,0:16:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.44,0:16:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.58,0:16:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could figure out a\Nway to get these handcuffs off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm letting\Nyou guys off the chain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.44,0:16:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go give them hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.64,0:16:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to smackle the walls of the\Ntown of law with the guts, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got full authority to butcher them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Protecting me is your\None and only priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.62,0:16:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Funfrey?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.98,0:16:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There, good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.36,0:17:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got CP9 on my side, and I've\Ngot my trusty elephant sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I maintain my cool,\Nthere's nothing that can stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.64,0:17:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we're off to the Gates of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.68,0:17:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really think you can take this woman\Nfrom me, go ahead and try it, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.84,0:17:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Franky is alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats actually made it across!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They finally did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro is free at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's gonna join the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.95,0:17:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bro is one hell of a guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get him, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.96,0:17:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.32,0:17:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.02,0:17:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is in your hands, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.56,0:17:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, talk to me! You guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.84,0:17:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you old hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.00,0:17:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Start moving and just what the\Nhell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pulling a flat-out stupid stunt\Nwith Rocket Man like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, thanks for saving us and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.70,0:17:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you hear me? Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.12,0:17:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die, you old hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.46,0:18:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bloody gongers!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're damn lucky. You bloody\Nnose is all you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the ride\Nacross, Monster Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you guys, get up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.02,0:18:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been through worse than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.02,0:18:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, that's easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're made out of rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.12,0:18:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're lucky we're not in pieces\Nright now after a crash like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,See, you're all just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you guys are a bunch of weirdos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It felt like I should point that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.70,0:18:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a staircase over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better move it if\Nwe're gonna find Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've invaded the Tower of Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.38,0:19:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't ever find Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.64,0:19:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Luchi's already taken her\Nto the Gates of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and the chief's with them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for telling us where\Nwe should start looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.52,0:19:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Chababa, why'd I tell them that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.78,0:19:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.42,0:19:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have told you\Nwhere they're headed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.02,0:19:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm not gonna tell\Nyou how to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.08,0:19:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll never make\Nit past our CP9 agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.62,0:19:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been given direct orders\Nto eliminate you, Chapa-Bah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he say eliminate us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.60,0:19:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You want Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.30,0:19:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're gonna have to\Nfight your way through each
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.52,0:19:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and every one of our agents\Nif you want to succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.87,0:19:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I liked it better when you were telling\Nus things we didn't already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.56,0:19:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Chapa-Bah, you've got some fire in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.64,0:20:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've got one more thing to\Ntell you. Say it. We're listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.96,0:20:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, give me just a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.06,0:20:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A key?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.16,0:20:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,For all you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it might be the key needed to unlock\NNico Robin's C-PRISM Stone handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,C-PRISM Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.24,0:20:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a stone that nullifies a\Nperson's Devil Fruit abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's basically the same as\Nwhen they fall into the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now we finally know why\NRobin hasn't been fighting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.06,0:20:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it wasn't adding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's not the\Ntype to give up so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'd be mopping the floor with\Ntheir ugly mugs if she had the choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She must feel so helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.06,0:20:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you were able to get past us\Nand save her in some imaginary world,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that C-prism stone is\Ntougher than a diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.10,0:20:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd have to live with them on her\Nwrists for the rest of her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.72,0:20:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I keep telling them this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He really is dumb, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.64,0:20:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.06,0:21:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Go try to save her if you think you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.32,0:21:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.60,0:21:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me that key!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.08,0:21:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess all the CP9 guys can use that move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.32,0:21:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.86,0:21:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know if this is\Nthe actual key I've got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.32,0:21:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You have got to be freaking kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be a key to another\Npair of cuffs. For all you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.50,0:21:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,cha-ba-ba-ba-ba!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.38,0:21:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In this great tower of law.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There are five members\Nof CP9, including me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.88,0:21:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And each and every member\Nhas a very own need.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's get in the game, hide and seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying we gotta\Nbeat each one of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And then try every key on our handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.48,0:21:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the only way we're\Ngonna find the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.02,0:21:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What a stupid way to keep us busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.92,0:22:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,While we're wasting time\Non your key hunting game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.56,0:22:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your chief is gonna\Nescape through those gates
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,with Rob retrieving Robin\Nis our first priority?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.48,0:22:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If we focus on getting Robin back first,\Nwe can worry about the key is afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.52,0:22:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just ignore that\Nweirdo and start searching
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you've got some brains,\Nbut I'm afraid if you do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.00,0:22:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,then you'll leave me with no choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.12,0:22:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll toss this kid to the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're kind enough to give\Nyou guys a sporting chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.24,0:22:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.56,0:22:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.80,0:22:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.71,0:22:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you just wait a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.18,0:22:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop running and listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.48,0:22:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's decide what we're going\Nto do before we split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.36,0:22:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a hold of yourself, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.58,0:22:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing Luchi's that pigeon guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.82,0:22:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,From what that freak told us, he's the\Nonly one they've got guarding Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.56,0:23:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Our best bet's to send Luffy after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.22,0:23:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, since you're raring to go,\Nyou can hunt down that pigeon guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.12,0:23:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where we go? Where we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.36,0:23:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Excluding Luffy, we've\Ngot a head count of six.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.10,0:23:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He said there are only\Nfive CP9 agents with keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.52,0:23:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So I say we spread out, take them\Ndown, and catch up with Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.12,0:23:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If they drag her across those\Ngates, we'll never get her back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.28,0:23:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a race against time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.70,0:23:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.30,0:23:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down, or we die\Ntrying. Yeah! Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.96,0:23:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, pirate guys, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.78,0:23:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.96,0:23:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.56,0:23:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chimney? Gombe!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.38,0:23:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did those two disappear to?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.72,0:23:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have taken Robin this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.24,0:23:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They couldn't have gotten too far ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.94,0:23:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let them take you\Nthrough the Gates of Justice, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.46,0:24:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no help for you, Nico Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.56,0:24:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can keep wishing for them to come,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.80,0:24:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but they'll never find their\Nway to the Gates of Justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.56,0:24:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,AHAHAHA! AHAHAHA!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.56,0:24:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.47,0:24:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,QUIT HIDDING FROM ME,\NYOU PIDGEON-LOVING JERK!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.12,0:24:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta find the kitchen\Nbefore I do any more fightin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.76,0:24:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in serious trouble if I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.10,0:24:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,CUDABOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.50,0:24:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a bottle and a half of\Ncola to properly fuel Cudaboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.90,0:24:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've already managed to go through\Na little more than two of them today!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.02,0:24:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta nab at least three full\Nbottles if I'm gonna take on CP9!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.34,0:24:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? There!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.12,0:24:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's got to be the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.68,0:24:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come face-to-face with\Nthe gossip-loving silent Fukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.50,0:24:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you want my keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:25:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, just move where I\Ncan refill my cola! Zappa!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.78,0:25:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.34,0:25:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.72,0:25:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.46,0:25:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.60,0:25:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.86,0:25:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find anyone around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.26,0:25:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I really mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.76,0:25:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you're too afraid to freeze the m -
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.62,0:25:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.60,0:25:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.76,0:25:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he with CP9?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.38,0:25:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.38,0:25:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He just let the key out\Nwhile he's taking a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.60,0:26:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My luck couldn't possibly\Nbe this good, could it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.52,0:26:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a golden opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.60,0:26:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.98,0:26:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like some kind of dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.32,0:26:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hopeless quest for\Nyour friend's freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.88,0:26:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,has doomed you to die a\Ndreadful death by my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.12,0:26:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear my words?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.80,0:26:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.80,0:26:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I said you're doomed. Doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.36,0:26:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Doomed. OOOJU!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.30,0:26:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,YOYOY!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.16,0:26:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, he's allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.16,0:26:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This room better not be empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.16,0:26:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.16,0:26:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting real tired of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.14,0:27:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.54,0:27:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.18,0:27:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put on some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.34,0:27:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that sounds wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.36,0:27:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your swords are drawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.78,0:27:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't waste time!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.80,0:27:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been thirsty\Nfor the taste of blood?
